			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Lisa"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 101010701,
					"content": "The thief lives inside <color=#00E1FFFF>ruins</color>? Mondstadt people do have some strange quirks.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101010702
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 101010702,
					"content": "Please do not jump to such a preposterous conclusion about the living habits of Mondstadt's residents.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101010703
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 101010703,
					"content": "This seems far more likely to be the work of some none-too-friendly troublemakers.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101010704,
						101010707,
						101010709
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 101010704,
					"content": "Hilichurls?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101010705
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 101010705,
					"content": "Stealing books is hardly the hilichurls' style.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101010706
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 101010706,
					"content": "All they would use books for is to keep their campfire going anyway.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101010712
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 101010712,
					"content": "This is more likely to be the <color=#00E1FFFF>Abyss Order's</color> doing. They do seem to have a way of slipping in and out of places like ghosts, after all.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101010713
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 101010713,
					"content": "Also... There is an elemental seal at the entrance. It looks like the result of an Abyss Mage's magic.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101010714
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 101010714,
					"content": "A seal? How are we gonna break it? Is this gonna turn into another huge ordeal?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101010715
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 101010715,
					"content": "Not to worry. If you think a little magic can keep me out, think again!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101010716
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 101010716,
					"content": "Why is that?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101010717
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 101010717,
					"content": "Come on.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101010718
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 101010718,
					"content": "Whoa...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101010719
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 101010719,
					"content": "So this is what Lisa's like when she's hard at work...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 101010707,
					"content": "The Abyss Order?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101010708
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 101010708,
					"content": "It's like you can read my mind.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101010712
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 101010709,
					"content": "The Adventurers' Guild?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101010710
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 101010710,
					"content": "It's not unlike them, in the sense that they are known for darting around amongst underground ruins.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101010711
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 101010711,
					"content": "But Adventurers do not typically take others' belongings... Well, not from the living, anyway.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101010712
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 1010108,
			"completionStepIds": [
				1010108
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"1010108",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 1010108,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Lisa"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 101010801,
					"content": "It's <color=#00E1FFFF>The Pale Princess and the Six Pygmies</color>! Paimon remembers that name, is this the one you were looking for?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101010802
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 101010802,
					"content": "That's the one. It's a good thing it isn't damaged, otherwise...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101010803
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 101010803,
					"content": "Otherwise what? Are you telling me you have even more crazy punishments up your sleeve!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101010804
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 101010804,
					"content": "Hehe. I would probably have needed to dish out a little taste of one of my potions in that case.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101010805
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 101010805,
					"content": "Ah!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101010806
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 101010806,
					"content": "Then again... As I said, it isn't from the restricted section. Which is the only reason I would let the average citizen borrow it in the first place.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101010807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 101010807,
					"content": "And it doesn't appear to have any abnormal elemental properties, save for the markings I put on it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101010808
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 101010808,
					"content": "Yeah... It seems like just an average storybook.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101010809,
						101010810
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 101010809,
					"content": "So why did the Abyss Order...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101010810
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 101010810,
					"content": "(How mysterious. I'm so curious...)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101010811
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 101010811,
					"content": "As far as my duties as a librarian go, my troublesome work is finished.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101010812
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 101010812,
					"content": "Since this book has piqued your interest, why don't I let you borrow it?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101010813,
						101010814
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 101010813,
					"content": "What's the, um, due date?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101010814
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 101010814,
					"content": "Please don't punish me if I return it late...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101010815
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 101010815,
					"content": "There's no time limit for you. I will register you as \"custodian\" rather than \"borrower.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101010816
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 101010816,
					"content": "This is an exclusive privilege reserved for trusted citizens only.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101010817
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 101010817,
					"content": "Exclusive privilege? Why does Paimon feel this is just your sneaky way of offloading your troublesome work onto someone else?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101010818
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 101010818,
					"content": "Excuse me? Are you in some way dissatisfied with my work?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101010819,
						101010820
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 101010819,
					"content": "No ma'am!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101010820
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 101010820,
					"content": "I will take extra special care of this book...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101010821
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 101010821,
					"content": "Good. You are amenable to reason then. I do wish I could keep you by my side as my personal assistant...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101010822
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 101010822,
					"content": "My work here is done. I'm going back.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101010823
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 101010823,
					"content": "Don't forget to register at the library when you have a spare moment.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 1010110,
			"completionStepIds": [
				1010110
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"1010110",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 1010110,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Lisa"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 101011001,
					"content": "Ah, you've returned. The paperwork is done — you are now the custodian of this book.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101011002
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 101011002,
					"content": "Thank you Miss Lisa!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101011003
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 101011003,
					"content": "...But Paimon thinks we're forgetting something.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101011004,
						101011005
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 101011004,
					"content": "The Teyvat Travel Guide!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101011007
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 101011007,
					"content": "Look, over there on the shelf! Isn't that the <color=#00E1FFFF>Teyvat Travel Guide</color>?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101011008
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 101011008,
					"content": "And look how many copies there are!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101011009
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 101011009,
					"content": "Hehe... The <color=#00E1FFFF>Teyvat Travel Guide</color> is a serial publication. It is not part of the library's formal collection.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101011010
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 101011010,
					"content": "Oh...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101011011
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 101011011,
					"content": "Take one. Consider it your compensation for being Lisa's little helper today.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101011012
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 101011012,
					"content": "With you by my side, my troublesome work was a little less dull than usual.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101011013
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 101011013,
					"content": "Hmph! The Teyvat Travel Guide was just bait to get us to do a day's work!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101011014
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 101011014,
					"content": "I hadn't anticipated that a few routine returns inquiries would take us out of the city, let alone down into some underground ruins.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101011015
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 101011015,
					"content": "As compensation for dragging you into all this bother, take these souvenirs.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101011016
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 101011016,
					"content": "Wow, Lisa went and bought us some special souvenirs!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101011017
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 101011017,
					"content": "In fact, they were intended for our next outing, but... Never mind, we can discuss next time's activity when the time comes. I hope you are looking forward to it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101011018
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 101011018,
					"content": "*yawn*",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				},
				{
					"id": 101011005,
					"content": "Remuneration!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101011006
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 101011006,
					"content": "You are a voracious one, aren't you?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						101011007
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lisa"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 1010112,
